atically).\n```"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"If you are running DSH from a source checkout with `pnpm run dev:web` and\nre-enable `client-hmr`, ed"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"its to `lib/client.js` hot-reload without restart."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. Remove the block from `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`.\n2. `rm -rf ~/.dsh/profiles/web/node"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"_modules/dsh-plugin-mermaid`.\n3. Restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"MIT © lj970926"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
